<link href="/css/site.css" rel="stylesheet" />
<section class="hero-section text-center">
    <div class="container">
        <h1 class="display-4">FAQs</h1>
    </div>
</section>
<div class="container text-dark mb-5">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-lg-12">
            <div class="faqs-card p-4 mb-3">
                <h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="accordion accordion-flush" id="accordionQuestion">

                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="accordionQuestionHeader0">
                                    <button class="accordion-button fs-15 fw-normal collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#accordionQuestionBody0">
                                        What is the minimum age for infants to travel by air? What documents are required?
                                    </button>
                                </h2>
                                <div class="accordion-collapse collapse" id="accordionQuestionBody0">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        Infants from 15 days old are allowed to fly. Required documents may vary, please check detailed guidelines when booking.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="accordionQuestionHeader1">
                                    <button class="accordion-button fs-15 fw-normal collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#accordionQuestionBody1" aria-expanded="false">
                                        What should I do if my flight ticket has the wrong name?
                                    </button>
                                </h2>
                                <div class="accordion-collapse collapse" id="accordionQuestionBody1">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        Please contact our support hotline for assistance. Name corrections depend on airline policies and may incur a fee.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="accordionQuestionHeader2">
                                    <button class="accordion-button fs-15 fw-normal collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#accordionQuestionBody2">
                                        Can I bring fruits and vegetables on a plane?
                                    </button>
                                </h2>
                                <div class="accordion-collapse collapse" id="accordionQuestionBody2">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        Yes, odorless fruits and vegetables are generally allowed. Strong-smelling items (e.g., durian, jackfruit) must be properly packed and may be restricted depending on airline policies.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="accordionQuestionHeader3">
                                    <button class="accordion-button fs-15 fw-normal collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#accordionQuestionBody3">
                                        Do I need to print my flight ticket?
                                    </button>
                                </h2>
                                <div class="accordion-collapse collapse" id="accordionQuestionBody3">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        No. You can use your e-ticket or QR code on your phone for check-in.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="accordionQuestionHeader4">
                                    <button class="accordion-button fs-15 fw-normal collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#accordionQuestionBody4">
                                        Can I change my ticket after booking?
                                    </button>
                                </h2>
                                <div class="accordion-collapse collapse" id="accordionQuestionBody4">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        Yes, but changes usually involve a fee and fare difference depending on airline policies.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="accordionQuestionHeader5">
                                    <button class="accordion-button fs-15 fw-normal collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#accordionQuestionBody5">
                                        Do children or elderly passengers need special assistance?
                                    </button>
                                </h2>
                                <div class="accordion-collapse collapse" id="accordionQuestionBody5">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        Yes, special assistance services can be requested in advance through the airline.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="accordion accordion-flush" id="accordionQuestion2">

                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="accordionQuestion2Header0">
                                    <button class="accordion-button fs-15 fw-normal collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#accordionQuestion2Body0">
                                        Can I fly if I lost my ID card?
                                    </button>
                                </h2>
                                <div class="accordion-collapse collapse" id="accordionQuestion2Body0">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        Yes, you may use alternative documents such as a passport, driver's license, or identity confirmation certificate.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="accordionQuestion2Header1">
                                    <button class="accordion-button fs-15 fw-normal collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#accordionQuestion2Body1">
                                        What should I do if my luggage is lost?
                                    </button>
                                </h2>
                                <div class="accordion-collapse collapse" id="accordionQuestion2Body1">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        Stay calm and report immediately to airport staff or the airline’s baggage service counter for assistance.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="accordionQuestion2Header2">
                                    <button class="accordion-button fs-15 fw-normal collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#accordionQuestion2Body2">
                                        How early should I arrive at the airport?
                                    </button>
                                </h2>
                                <div class="accordion-collapse collapse" id="accordionQuestion2Body2">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        Domestic flights: arrive at least 2 hours before departure (check-in closes 40 minutes prior).<br>
                                        International flights: arrive at least 3 hours before departure (check-in closes 50 minutes prior).
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="accordionQuestion2Header3">
                                    <button class="accordion-button fs-15 fw-normal collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#accordionQuestion2Body3">
                                        How can I book a flight ticket?
                                    </button>
                                </h2>
                                <div class="accordion-collapse collapse" id="accordionQuestion2Body3">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        You can book tickets online via our website or visit our office directly.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="accordionQuestion2Header4">
                                    <button class="accordion-button fs-15 fw-normal collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#accordionQuestion2Body4">
                                        Are there limits for carry-on and checked baggage?
                                    </button>
                                </h2>
                                <div class="accordion-collapse collapse" id="accordionQuestion2Body4">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        Yes. Carry-on baggage is typically 7–10kg, while checked baggage depends on the airline and ticket class, usually 20–30kg.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="accordionQuestion2Header5">
                                    <button class="accordion-button fs-15 fw-normal collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#accordionQuestion2Body5">
                                        Do I need a visa for international flights?
                                    </button>
                                </h2>
                                <div class="accordion-collapse collapse" id="accordionQuestion2Body5">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        It depends on your destination country. Please check visa requirements before traveling.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
               </div> 
            <div class="container">
                <h4>For any questions, please contact us at: 098 947 3579</h4>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>